  <section class="faq" id="faq-section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
    <div class="head">
      <span class="eyebrow">+ FAQ</span>
      <h2 id="faq-title">
        Mobile App Development <em>FAQs</em>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="list">
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <div class="q open">
        <h3>
          <button type="button" id="faq-appdev-btn-1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-appdev-ans-1">
            Do you build native iOS, native Android, or cross-platform mobile apps?
            <i class="ic" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div class="a" id="faq-appdev-ans-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-appdev-btn-1">
          <div>
            <p>
              We build both. For graphics-intensive, hardware-coupled applications we build native Swift/SwiftUI for iOS
              and Kotlin/Jetpack Compose for Android. For high-velocity commercial products, we leverage Flutter and
              React Native to deliver 120 FPS native performance with a single unified codebase.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <div class="q">
        <h3>
          <button type="button" id="faq-appdev-btn-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-appdev-ans-2">
            How do you manage App Store and Google Play Store submission and approvals?
            <i class="ic" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div class="a" id="faq-appdev-ans-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-appdev-btn-2">
          <div>
            <p>
              We manage the entire deployment lifecycle end-to-end: Apple Developer and Google Play Console
              provisioning, cryptographic signing, privacy policy compliance, metadata optimization, and App Store
              Review guidelines compliance until official live release.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <div class="q">
        <h3>
          <button type="button" id="faq-appdev-btn-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-appdev-ans-3">
            Can the app function offline with background data synchronization?
            <i class="ic" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div class="a" id="faq-appdev-ans-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-appdev-btn-3">
          <div>
            <p>
              Yes. We implement resilient local SQLite/Room/CoreData persistence with conflict-free replicated data
              types (CRDTs) or queued bidirectional sync, allowing users to perform actions offline that seamlessly
              reconcile once network connectivity returns.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <div class="q">
        <h3>
          <button type="button" id="faq-appdev-btn-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-appdev-ans-4">
            How do you ensure enterprise-grade mobile security and data privacy?
            <i class="ic" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div class="a" id="faq-appdev-ans-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-appdev-btn-4">
          <div>
            <p>
              Our mobile security framework includes AES-256 local database encryption, SSL/TLS certificate pinning,
              biometric authentication (Face ID / Fingerprint), jailbreak/root detection, and strict OWASP Mobile Top 10
              compliance.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <div class="q">
        <h3>
          <button type="button" id="faq-appdev-btn-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-appdev-ans-5">
            What backend architecture powers your mobile applications?
            <i class="ic" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div class="a" id="faq-appdev-ans-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-appdev-btn-5">
          <div>
            <p>
              We architect scalable cloud backends on AWS, Google Cloud, or your private sovereign servers using
              Node.js, Go, or Python with PostgreSQL, Redis caching, real-time WebSockets, and serverless push
              notification pipelines (APNs &amp; FCM).
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 6 -->
      <div class="q">
        <h3>
          <button type="button" id="faq-appdev-btn-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-appdev-ans-6">
            What post-launch maintenance and OS update support do you provide?
            <i class="ic" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div class="a" id="faq-appdev-ans-6" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-appdev-btn-6">
          <div>
            <p>
              We provide comprehensive 24/7 SLA maintenance covering annual major iOS and Android OS version migrations,
              third-party API deprecations, crash reporting via Sentry/Firebase, performance telemetry, and regular
              security patching.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="foot">
      <p>Have questions about your project scope, architecture, or timeline?</p>
